Subject: [PATCH] =?UTF-8?q?The=20Pok=C3=A9dex's=20registration=20page:=20i?=
 =?UTF-8?q?ts=20text=20box's=20label=20one=20even=20height=20(SDK=5FPORT?=
 =?UTF-8?q?=5F3DS)?=
